  "title": "Pickled Padrón Peppers",
  "description": "Pickled Padrón peppers in a tangy, sweet brine are a fantastic accompaniment to salad dressings, marinades, and more.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
  "date_published": "2012-05-04T16:40:14-04:00",
